WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
The precious arms

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
This love...

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
Omoi wo

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.690
Target sighted.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.990
AR System, standby OK!

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.660
Shield generator, starting up.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.040
Irradiate AR System.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.870
Irradiating AR System.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.410
Sleeping Beauty

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.410
Operation complete.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.370
Two Ryna sapiens captured.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.750
Transporting to headquarters now.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.000
Roger. We'll notify the director right away.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.380
Command Vehicle Two will hold up the end.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:34.590
Roger.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.970
The reinforced AR System is
pretty awesome, isn't it?

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.510
Don't let your guard down yet!

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.180
Y-yes!

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:09.500
What? What is this place?

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.920
Let me out...

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.470
LET ME OUT!

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:26.680
What was that sound?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:28.980
Hey, what's this?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:31.560
This is...

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.440
Th-This is Vehicle One.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.230
What's wrong?!

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.230
It's the Ryna sapien! The shield is...

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:38.320
Impossible!

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.900
You mean she woke up?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.650
Kurau!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.750
Christmas...

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.760
Where is Christmas?!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.930
What's wrong?! What's going on?!

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:12.810
Christmas!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:13.810
Why?

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.690
Why doesn't the AR System work on her?!

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.530
Ch-Christmas... Where are you?!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.780
AR System! Ready to fire?

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.080
Ch-Christmas...

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.680
I'll go after Kurau.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.970
Inspector Wong, escort the other girl.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.060
Inspector Wong!

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.770
We have no choice. We'll split up the unit.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:55.100
Ayaka, our orders are to capture her.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.480
Not to hurt her, got that?

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:58.520
Roger.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.240
She's falling.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.740
She's weakening.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:11.120
We'll search for her on the ground.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:40.230
I'm... like a human being.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:46.030
She... was taken away by them...

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:47.990
Christmas...

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:51.080
This world... is so wide, isn't it?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.040
I'll go with you.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.460
What are people trying to do to Rynax?

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.250
Kurau...

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:06.920
Christmas...

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.180
Christmas...

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:11.930
Christmas...

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.810
How could they...

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:16.270
I won't forgive them...

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.940
Won't forgive them... won't forgive them...

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.020
Christmas!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.400
What's this reaction?

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:28.780
What's wrong?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.120
The Rynax are showing abnormal numbers...

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.780
That's ridiculous... A state like this is...

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.450
It has exceeded the safety level.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.210
Sound the alarm! Check all areas, on the double!

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.250
This can't be...

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:40.670
This is...

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:45.170
This is... like the accident on the Moon two years ago!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.340
I can hear...

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.470
the voice...

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.180
Who is it?

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.310
Rynax?

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.350
Are you angry?

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.370
Hey!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.080
Get a hold of yourself, Kurau!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.330
Hey!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.040
Man, look at that face.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.920
Detective Ayaka, this is Vehicle Three.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.800
I've found our target.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.300
Don't lose sight of her!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.430
Damn!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.830
What happened to Christmas?

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.160
Jeez, look at you!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.040
See what happens when you act on your own?!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.000
Does it hurt?

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.300
You're injured...

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.300
These injuries... don't hurt.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:14.470
Don't hurt at all...

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.100
Are you really Kurau?!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.850
You're nothing like the Kurau I know!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.100
If you're Kurau, then start acting like her!

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.610
First, I gotta lose these guys.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.110
Get ready for a bumpy ride.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:35.160
There they are. That's the car!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.960
There it is! Set us down!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.560
Dammit. Which one are they on?

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.310
Shut down the stations on both sides.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.020
Yes!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.320
I'm sure they're waiting at the next station.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.610
We have three minutes...

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:17.950
Rest awhile.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.060
Why?

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.900
Why did you save me?

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.560
Who knows?

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:54.940
Even I don't know why I bother with all this trouble.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.870
Maybe it's because I see how vulnerable you are...

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.170
Oh, yeah.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:11.380
Your dad called me.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.880
Really?

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.010
Yeah, but I'll tell you about that later.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.510
Can you stand now?

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:22.930
What's wrong?

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.430
What?!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.180
Who is it?!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:36.110
All lines have been shut down
due to a power outage.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.900
Please stay calm. The station
workers will be directing you.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.330
What's wrong?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.420
Why are you crying?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.550
Did you hit something?

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.390
Tears... Why?

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.350
You don't know?

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:06.640
Killed...

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.640
That's right. Just now...

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.060
Rynax were killed.

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:15.150
So many Rynax were killed...

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.570
Rynax?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.990
What do you mean? Killed?

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.530
I don't know...

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.910
But the Rynax that were there were all killed.

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:31.080
Killed... They were killed...

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:34.960
Trouble with Rynax Energy?

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.050
We have backup power,

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.090
so the outage will be fixed right away.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.630
What happened to Rynax Energy?

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.770
Look into it.

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:48.560
Roger.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:53.310
I'm going to go check.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.520
Ayaka!

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.280
We're sorry for the inconvenience.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.660
We're working to fix the problem.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.450
Please wait a while longer.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.830
Kurau, please get up.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.710
They'll be coming after us.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:42.440
She might be running on these tracks now too.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.370
You cannot do this.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.120
The trains will start moving soon.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.270
Vehicles Two and Three have arrived at the scene.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.480
I'm sorry, I lost them.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.360
Yes, I understand.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.900
All right, I will head for the Moon as well.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:25.610
Yes.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.360
Roger.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.950
Sorry about that, Ayaka.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.080
About Rynax Energy...

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:38.250
In the generator system, there was a sudden
abnormal increase in the number of Rynax.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.710
What?

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.170
However, there was no damage to the plant.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:46.180
Because the safety system was activated,
and the Rynax were terminated.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:50.640
We're currently searching for the cause, but it's still unknown.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.060
I see.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.390
Step up the security checkpoints.
They can't have gone far.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:57.100
Yes!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:03.280
She was trying to save... the other one...

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.530
Christmas!

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.570
Christmas...

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.070
Where are you?

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.120
I know she'll come to look for her.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.580
And when that time comes...

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.180
Your father is on the Moon.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:33.310
That... Rynax stuff... He's doing research on that.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.600
Under the supervision of GPO.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:39.440
So my dad really did make that weapon.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:46.490
Your dad said he developed Rynax Energy
and GPO exploited his research.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.360
What's the difference?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:51.620
Rynax were killed there.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:56.200
I heard them... all their screams.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.620
It's horrible...

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.580
Just horrible.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.960
I've never even met your dad.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.220
I just talked to him on the phone.

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.680
But you know, I felt it.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:16.180
Right now, your dad lives to protect you...

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.640
it's all for you.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:21.980
Believe me!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:26.400
No matter how far apart they may be,
a parent always wants to protect his child!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.070
That's what I'd like to believe!

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.990
A child doubting his parent
is something I cannot tolerate.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.410
I want to believe too.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:44.170
I want to see Dad... and talk to him.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.010
You want to go look for your dad?

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.300
Right now, I have to go save Christmas.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.850
Christmas is on her way to the Moon.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:57.850
What?!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.270
We got a tip.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.520
A tip?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:06.650
Yeah, a special GPO shuttle
was launched into space.

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:10.900
She may have been taken to your dad's lab...

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.660
I'm not sure until I get more information.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.410
You go on ahead to the Moon.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.330
Okay.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.080
I'll go later.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.540
If we go together, we'll stand out too much.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.970
Listen, don't even think about acting alone.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.560
Remember you're jumping into enemy territory.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.020
I know...

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.520
I couldn't have gotten this far by myself...

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.480
Doug...

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.450
Um... I'm not sure how to say this...

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.780
It's still too early to thank me.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.800
I'll never get used to that no matter
how many times I see it.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.310
I wonder where you came from...

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.110
And where you should be going...

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:00.850
Sorry to keep you waiting, Dr. Amami.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:03.640
I'm sorry to call you out like this.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.690
What do you want?

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:11.230
Please take a look at the Ryna sapien
we obtained the other day.

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.900
Don't you mean "captured"?

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.740
Attractor Rynax System...

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.530
After the accident two years ago,

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:27.370
I heard you were upset we altered the safety system you devised, without your permission.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:31.210
And you also refuse to help us
make any improvements to it.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:34.210
Of course! Who would?!

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:37.090
Who would...

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:42.470
We have just obtained
a special type of Ryna sapien.

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:49.310
And I have decided that you should
take a look at this Ryna sapien.

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.730
It... can't be...

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.320
However...

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.530
Upon its capture,

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:02.700
this Ryna sapien was shot in the head
with the AR system and remains unconscious.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.130
Dr. Amami...

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.500
Please help me.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:20.180
That is the best way for you...

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:35.110
Sleeping Beauty, huh?

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.620
Director Saito...

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.540
I didn't know you were here.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.580
Where are the guards?

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.790
Don't worry about it.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:03.390
Hm?

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.180
Let's go.

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.160
K-Kurau!

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.420
No, it's not...

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.420
She looks like her, but this girl is...

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:41.630
Could it be...

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.630
Could it be?

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:46.600
She's a Ryna sapien who lived with Kurau.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.220
Kurau called her Christmas.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.350
Christmas!

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.980
I see... She called her Christmas...

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.710
F-Forgive me...

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:18.880
for not being able to save you two!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
From a great distance

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
You smile at me

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.420
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.420
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.310
Moonlight

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.870
Next Episode

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:12.200
Don't do anything rash, Kurau.

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.160
I know.

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:16.660
I can't save Christmas with my power alone.

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:18.410
I need your help, Doug.

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:20.370
I'll be there soon.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:22.500
Hold until I get there.

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:24.880
Inviting Voice
